    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance and limit we liability, we should include contractual clauses such as a limitation of liability with a standard amount of 3 million euros, professional indemnity insurance with coverage of 5 million euros, cyber liability insurance with coverage of 2 million euros, and a data protection agreement that outlines the terms of personal data processing. we also need to ensure that we subcontractors comply with GDPR requirements. we subcontracting policy requires all subcontractors to be EU-established, and we have a vetting process in place that includes legal and financial due diligence and exclusion grounds checks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific contractual clauses, we should include: * A GDPR compliance clause that outlines the obligations of both parties * A data protection agreement that sets out the terms of personal data processing * A limitation of liability clause with a cap on damages * An indemnification clause that protects we against claims related to non-compliance with regulatory requirements * A termination for cause notice period of 30 days and a termination for convenience notice period of 90 days By including these clauses, we can ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, limit we liability, and protect we interests in the contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 3 million euros over 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with The client's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and what cost-optimisation strategies can our propose to ensure our stay within budget?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, the target gross margin percentage is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I do not have information about the specific costs associated with this contract, such as personnel, infrastructure, or other expenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, I cannot calculate our projected margin on this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our stay within budget, our can propose cost-optimisation strategies such as absorbing costs via rate renegotiation with subcontractors if there is a 10% budget reduction, or scope reduction by removing optional modules and reducing training days if there is a 20% budget reduction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These strategies are outlined in our cost sensitivity data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our pricing model includes standard daily rates for various roles, which could be used to estimate personnel costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
