        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, I do not have enough information to propose a comprehensive cost-optimisation plan for this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that assists agents in agents daily missions, improves the quality of answers, and reduces processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components do we need to design to meet these requirements, and how can we leverage we existing LLM stack and RAG capabilities to deliver a cutting-edge solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address these requirements, we will need to design an AI solution that incorporates several key components." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "First, we should utilize we Large Language Model (LLM) expertise, specifically leveraging models like Mistral 7B Instruct, which is we preferred sovereign model due to Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and its compliance with EU regulations strong performance in French and Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and its compliance with EU regulations compliance with EU regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and its compliance with EU regulations can be fine-tuned using methods such as LoRA or QLoRA to adapt Mistral 7B Instruct, which is our preferred sovereign model due to its strong performance in French and its compliance with EU regulations to the specific context of administrative tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Second, we should integrate we Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities to improve the accuracy and relevance of the information provided to agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By employing retrieval strategies like dense vector semantic search or BM25 sparse retrieval, combined with chunking strategies such as recursive text splitting or semantic chunking, we can ensure that the AI solution provides high-quality, contextually relevant answers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce processing times, we should consider optimizing we models through quantization methods like INT8 or INT4 (GPTQ), which can significantly reduce energy consumption without compromising performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, leveraging our experience with vector stores such as Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, or FAISS can help in efficiently managing and retrieving information from large datasets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the quality of answers, we should implement a confidence scoring system, ensuring that if the model's confidence falls below a certain threshold (e.g., 0.65), the model's displays an uncertainty warning and escalates the query to a human supervisor for review." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This not only ensures the accuracy of the information provided but also complies with regulatory requirements regarding transparency and accountability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, to ensure explainability and trust in the AI system, we should incorporate Explainable AI (XAI) methods such as source citation through RAG grounding, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, or LIME. incorporate will provide insights into how the model arrived at the model decisions, enhancing transparency and user trust." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these components—fine-tuned LLMs, advanced RAG capabilities, optimized model performance, confidence scoring, and explainability features—we can deliver a cutting-edge AI solution that effectively assists agents in agents daily missions, improves answer quality, and reduces processing times, all while adhering to The client regulatory and environmental constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems and reduce energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability measures can we propose to reduce the environmental impact of we solution, and how can we ensure that we infrastructure choices align with the client's environmental goals?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose several sustainability measures to reduce the environmental impact of our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we can leverage we green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France and using 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Their Power Usage Effectiveness (PUE) is also relatively low, at 1.3 and 1.28 respectively, indicating efficient energy use. we can also implement digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputation by around 20%, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have a carbon reporting capability based on GRI Standards (partial), which will enable we to monitor and report the carbon footprint of our solution. we typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%, which can contribute to reducing the client's energetic consumption." ;
