        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our team has experience in delivering large-scale public sector projects, including digital workplace transformation and AI-powered document management systems. our consortium partners, including EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, and GreenCompute S.r.l., bring complementary expertise to ensure successful project delivery. our propose a comprehensive approach that includes a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by progressive generalization to the entirety of services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

