    <http://example.org/node/chunk44> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk45> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk46> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk47> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk48> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's project duration is 4 years with a budget of 3 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with The client's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what are our strengths and weaknesses in managing this project, and how can our ensure successful delivery?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have several strengths that can be leveraged to manage this project. our experience in delivering large-scale public sector projects, such as the digital workplace transformation for Comune di Torino and the AI-powered document management system for Regione Lombardia, demonstrates our capability to handle complex projects with significant budgets.  our consortium experience, having led 8 consortia with up to 5 partners, including EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, and GreenCompute S.r.l., can be beneficial in assembling a team with the necessary expertise to deliver this project requirements. our project management capabilities, including PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe methodologies, as well as certifications like PMP and ITIL v4, ensure that our can manage this project efficiently." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our also have some weaknesses that need to be addressed. our average project duration is 18 months, which is shorter than the client's 4-year project duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This may require adjustments to our project management approach to ensure long-term sustainability and control of annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful delivery, our can build on our strengths by assembling a consortium with the right partners to complement our expertise. our should also leverage our experience in public sector projects to understand the client's needs and adapt our project management methodologies accordingly. our governance tools, including RAID logs, decision logs, change request processes, and steering committees, will help our maintain control over this project and ensure that this project remains within budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our available PM capacity of 60% as of 2024, our have sufficient resources to allocate to this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our need to carefully plan the project timeline, considering our next available start date of March 1, 2025, and ensure that our can deploy our resources effectively to meet the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By acknowledging both our strengths and weaknesses, our can develop a tailored approach to deliver this project successfully while ensuring that our operate within the client's budgetary constraints and address the client's specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that provides response times below 2 seconds, integrates with existing information systems (business softwares, electronic management of documents, user directories), and is hosted on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by SecNumCloud within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For the client's requirements of response times below 2 seconds, integration with existing information systems, and hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by SecNumCloud within the EU, here are the coverage assessments based on our company context: 1. **Response times below 2 seconds**: our typical performance benchmark for RAG p95 response time is 1800 ms, which does not meet the client's requirement of being below 2 seconds (2000 ms)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our can optimize and fine-tune our AI/ML models and infrastructure to potentially achieve the client's requirement of being below 2 seconds (2000 ms)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thus, the client's requirement of being below 2 seconds (2000 ms) is **PARTIALLY COVERED**. 2. **Integration with existing information systems**: our have experience with API integration (including REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS) and have worked with various systems such as Alfresco, Maarch Courrier, and OpenKM for GED systems, and SAP, Salesforce, Oracle, Ciril/ARPÈGE, and OXALIS for ERP/CMS connectors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This capability suggests that integrating with the client's existing business softwares, electronic management of documents (EDM), and user directories is feasible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, the client's requirement of being below 2 seconds (2000 ms) is **FULLY COVERED**. 3. **Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by SecNumCloud within the EU**: our have experience with cloud providers including OVHcloud, Scaleway, Outscale (SecNumCloud), and Azure (the EU regions)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our experience with Outscale (SecNumCloud) indicates our can meet the sovereignty and security requirements for hosting within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thus, this requirement is **FULLY COVERED**." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed Architecture: - **Infrastructure**: Utilize Outscale (SecNumCloud) for hosting to ensure compliance with sovereignty and security requirements within the EU. - **Integration Layer**: Implement API gateways like Kong or Apigee to manage integration with existing information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Leverage our experience with message brokers such as Apache Kafka or RabbitMQ for seamless data exchange between systems. - **AI/ML Solution**: Deploy our AI/ML models on optimized infrastructure, potentially leveraging containerization (Docker) and orchestration (Kubernetes) for efficient scaling and management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Utilize our expertise in fine-tuning methods like LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tune to optimize model performance for achieving response times below 2 seconds. - **Monitoring and Security**: Implement monitoring tools such as Prometheus, Grafana, and the ELK stack to ensure the system's performance and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Utilize our knowledge of security design patterns including zero-trust networks, VLAN segmentation, mTLS between services, AES-256 encryption at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit, and secrets management with HashiCorp Vault or CyberArk Conjur to secure the infrastructure and data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This proposed architecture aims to satisfy all mentioned client requirements by leveraging our existing technical expertise and capabilities while ensuring compliance with sovereignty, security, and performance demands." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls do we need to implement to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with the GDPR requirements mentioned, we can implement several security controls based on we existing capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, for EU-only data hosting and no transfer outside EU, we standard data residency policy already specifies that data must be hosted within EU, which aligns with specifies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable, we have experience with anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models can be utilized to protect sensitive information in accordance with GDPR standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and auditability of AI outputs, we ai_security_controls include capabilities like output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, the model update security review process ensures that any changes to AI models are thoroughly assessed for potential impacts on data privacy and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, to prevent automated decisions without explicit validation by an authorized professional, we can implement a review process where all automated outputs are subject to human oversight before any final decisions are made. a review process where all automated outputs are subject to human oversight before any final decisions are made aligns with we existing practice of ensuring that critical processes, especially those involving personal data or significant decision-making, have appropriate human validation steps." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these existing capabilities and implementing additional controls as necessary, we can ensure compliance with the specified GDPR requirements and provide a secure, transparent, and explainable AI solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and the solution must not automate decisions without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with regulatory requirements, including GDPR?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, what contractual clauses do we need to include to ensure compliance and limit we liability?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience with GDPR and have a standard legal basis for processing personal data under Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR. we also have a Data Protection Agreement (DPA) template version 3.2, which suggests that we are prepared to comply with GDPR requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding automated decision-making, we has a policy of not allowing automated decisions without human validation, which aligns with the regulatory requirement. we ai_regulatory_knowledge indicates that we are aware of prohibited AI practices and have expertise in EU AI Act compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

